  "transducer-swarupa op-reduce-abheda"
  "morphism-abheda"
  "fold-yukta map-yukta"
  "sequence-janya"
  "state-phala"
  "domain-computation-sthita"

  shabda scan-accumulate, scan, mealy-machine / stateful-fold-over-input-sequence-with-epistemic-state-the-only-procedural-pattern-in-the-tantra-language

